window.products.push({"id":167006,"name":"100% Cotton Blanket, Cooling Blankets, Summer Blankets King Size, Waffle Blanket, Lightweight Blanket, King Size Throw Blanket, Soft Blanket, King Siz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81L2plfPpuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PERFECT FIT: The king blanket is 108 x 90 inches which makes it perfect for just about anything, from bedding to blankets. The king size blanket is perfect for those looking to stay warm on their couch, sofa, or bed. This luxurious fabric can also be used in your home decor with its beautiful colors that complement any home décor! COZY BLANKET FOR ALL SEASONS - These blankets are made of 100% cotton to give a delicate touch and for being gentle on your skin. They're durable and provide the perfect warmth without overheating, making them perfect for all-year-round use! Use this one in everyday situations like relaxing at home or using as bed spread while also being great choice if you're traveling light, making itself a bedding essential in daily life. It's also a great choice for dorm rooms and vacation homes. CARE TIPS: Make sure you wash your blankets separately from other items like towels, garments or curtains which could cause damage to the blanket as they are 100% cotton and delicate. Machine washing is best at low speeds with gentle cycle; avoid bleach & ironing! Follow care labels on each product for optimal results. Because our blankets are made out of 100% cotton, you might notice some lint during the first few washes but it should go away after each wash. BREATHABLE WAFFLE BLANKETS: Chateau Home Collection Waffle blankets provide the perfect balance of softness and warmth. Made from breathable materials that will keep you feeling comfortable all winter long, with moisture-absorbing properties to keep your bedding clean in between washings! This lightweight cover works well throughout springtime or summer months as well! IDEAL GIFT & GUARANTEED TO LAST : The perfect gift for any special occasion! Whether it's an anniversary, housewarming, Thanksgiving, Christmas, New Year, or just because you want to show your loved ones how much they mean in life - this is sure going be the ideal present. You'll love your new bedding set so much that you won't be able to part ways with it. If you're not absolutely thrilled with your new bedding set, just write back and we will fix the problem for sure!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81L2plfPpuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHATEAU HOME COLLECTION","source_asin":"B0B7NX95L9","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-167006","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7NX95L9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7NX95L9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
