window.products.push({"id":167024,"name":"FINE LECHO Super Soft Luxurious, Stylish 3-Piece Edge Ruffle Frilled Duvet Cover Set 100% Egyptian Cotton 800 Thread Count Duvets Breathable Premium F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iJy-qLClL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"FINE LECHO Ultimate blend of craftsmanship and elegance, our linens are designed to offer you a unique and sophisticated sleeping experience. Stay clean: No need to dry clean the comforter, simply remove the duvet cover, and clean with regular laundry. Comfortable: No need to sleep with a top bed sheet (Flat Sheet) as the comforter itself stays clean. The result is a super cozy sleep. Efficient: No need to remove the comforter in the morning, just straighten it out, as its part of the bedding. Hypoallergenic, good for allergy suffer: Easier cleaning means dusts and dirt don’t find themselves comfortable on the bedding = Better for allergy suffers. Style Décor: You can always update you room for a new look, and match new style beddings. Free 100% Satisfaction Guarantee Included you’ll be amazed by our outstanding customer service, our #1 goal is to provide you with the  ultimate best customer service in the world and make you a lifetime happy customer, shop happy and confident with our 5-star satisfaction guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iJy-qLClL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FINE LECHO","source_asin":"B07858GY83","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-167024","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07858GY83","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07858GY83","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":167025,"name":"Waterford Crystal Clarion Double Old Fashioned Glasses, Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41TBZ9ZYJ9L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Sleek and sculpture that are as practical as they are unique describe this stunning pattern Amazon.com These Double Old Fashioned glasses from Waterford feel impressive in heft and agreeably sculptural to the touch. The Clarion line of crystal stemware and barware features a contemporary look of thin vertical cuts on a round bowl offset by a square base; in this case, a substantial, thick base appropriate for cocktail glasses. This set of four 11-ounce glasses, introduced in May 2003, makes a generous gift or enhances a home collection of Clarion crystal, which includes decanters, square bowls, candlesticks, and more. Each Clarion glass is crafted of full lead crystal for clarity and brilliance, a trademark of the world-renowned Waterford company. Like all fine crystal, Waterford stemware and barware should be washed by hand in moderately hot, soapy water, then rinsed and dried thoroughly to protect the porous surface from harsh detergents. A crystal glass should be stored upright, not on its delicate rim, to ensure longevity for generations to come. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41TBZ9ZYJ9L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Waterford Crystal","source_asin":"B0000C85UM","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-167025","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000C85UM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000C85UM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":167026,"name":"Ice Stick Trays, Fits Soda and Water Bottles, Set of 2, by Ocean Desert","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":4.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51E6B+CihoL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"ICE STICK TRAYS (SET OF 2)  ======================   * The easiest way to get ice into a water or soda bottle!  * Makes thin sticks of ice that go where ice cubes can't  * Each tray makes 10 ice sticks  * Trays measure: 10.5\" x 4.5\"  * Set of 2 trays","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51E6B+CihoL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ocean Desert Sales","source_asin":"B00G8E26AY","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-167026","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00G8E26AY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00G8E26AY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":167027,"name":"Easy-Going Reversible Office Chair Cover Water Resistant Dining Chair Cover Soft Desk Computer Chair Slipcover with Anti-Slip Buckle for Armchair or A","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fixzy4KhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Quality Material: Made of 3-layers quilted microfiber fabric, the office chair cover is very soft and comfortable. The fabric is water-resistant, can protect your chair from accident liquid spills. Besides the chair cover is reversible, you can use any side as you like. Cover Dimension: The size of whole piece chair cover is 21” width x 79” length, fits for chair back height 18\"-40\", back and seat width 18\"-26\", seat length 15\"-26\". Pleasure measure your chair size before purchase. Anti-Slip Design: There are 4 straps with quick-release buckle which can keep the chair cover stay in place better. Two of them are tied to the backrest and other two tied to the chair seat. And the straps can be adjusted for a tight fit so that you do not need to adjust the cover after sitting. Wide Application: The chair slipcover can fit most types of armchair or armless chair, office chair, dining chair, computer chair, desk chair, a great choice for home, study and office. Protect your chair from stain, dust, scratch, daily tear and wear. Easy to use: It is easy to put on and take off. Detailed installation instruction please refer to the installation picture. Machine washable at or below 30 degrees Celsius, mild laundry detergents are advised. Do not bleach, iron on a low temperature.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fixzy4KhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Easy-Going","source_asin":"B09JK42QBK","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-167027","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JK42QBK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JK42QBK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":167028,"name":"Floating Rustic Wood Shelves- Set of 2- Barn Door White Wash- Natural Pine Finish- Fir Wood & Iron- Wall Decor- Mounting Hardware Included- Farmhouse ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714CAbF+VlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎉 BEAUTIFUL STYLE! Our Addison shelf line is crafted of iron and fir wood. The wood is a premium cut of 1 inch solid wood, and the finish is available in a beautiful yet aged looking distressed white wash and a classic natural pine color. Both finishes against the black iron compliment each other beautifully! 🛠️ STURDY MOUNTING! Our shelves secure to the wall with with 4 point mounting, which means these shelves are very sturdy! No flimsy design like the other guys! All mounting hardware is included, only a Phillips head screw driver needed for assembly. 2️⃣ TWO SIZED SHELVES! Our set comes with two different sizes to fit our modern theme! You are going to have enough variation and room to use our shelves for anything you need! The medium shelf is 18.25\" wide x 6\" deep x 7\" high, and the small shelf is12.25\" wide x 6\" deep x 7\" high 🏆 CHAMPION OF DESIGN! One set is the perfect accent for a small wall, while using two sets can fill out a bigger wall! Excellent for plants, books, pictures, and other decor! These shelves stand apart from the rest due to their rustic yet modern design that goes with Industrial, Farmhouse, Contemporary, Mid-Century Modern and other popular decors! 🇺🇲 U.S.A. SMALL BUSINESS! Our design and testing is done in our office located in Arlington, Virginia then manufactured under strict standards with our partners overseas. Our support team stands behind our products and is always there if you need assistance! Customer satisfaction is at the heart of our small business!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714CAbF+VlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KARBAUN K","source_asin":"B08MJ4K85J","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-167028","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MJ4K85J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MJ4K85J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
