window.products.push({"id":167056,"name":"Pre-Seasoned Cast Iron Skillet by Royal Industries, 6-1/2\" Diam, Black, Commercial Grade","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61m-D8U1CjL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"A frying pan or a cookware is very essential to be in top shape as this is where every dish comes from. But, not every dish goes to meet your customers. Some get wasted due to over-heating, undercooking, scorching, etc. These factors make a frying pan invaluable. That is why Royal Industries has brought this 6.5\" Cast Iron Skillet (ROY CI 1102). The 6.5 inch means that it has enough space for you to fry your fajitas, eggs, steaks, etc. on this cast iron surface. Cast iron has supreme heat conduction which makes this evenly and consistently distribute the heat to the food thus resulting in optimum frying. This pan is also induction ready and if properly seasoned will become non-sticky.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61m-D8U1CjL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Royal Industries","source_asin":"B074HNMRT8","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-167056","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074HNMRT8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074HNMRT8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":167057,"name":"JIVINER Super Stretch Chair Slipcovers with Arms 1-Piece Jacquard Small Checks Living Room Armchair Covers Soft Anti Slip Sofa Couch Furniture Protect","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816x+-4ZZvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you are looking for an EFFORTLESS & AFFORDABLE way to update your living room, you've come to the right place! Easily upgrade your furniture in minutes with JIVINER premium Couch Covers High Elastic and Durable JIVINER durable sofa slipcovers are crafted by 85% Polyester and 15% Spandex fabric, ensuring the slip covers soft, comfortable, stretchy, and durable for long-time use. And stretchy enough to fit most types of couches. Full Protection Our couch slipcovers aim to provide a full coverage for your sofa furniture. Protect your sofa from daily stains, great for homes with pets, or for anyone seeking an economical way for couch protection Upgraded Fit and Decoration Soft sofa slipcovers can fit your sofa couch perfectly and become a centerpiece in your living room. Featuring with elastic bands and foam sticks, fitted sofa covers will not easily move or shift after using Size Choose Armchair slipcovers fit for width between 31-46 inches Loveseat slipcovers fit for width between 55-69 inches Sofa covers fit for width between 71-91 inches Extra large couch covers fit for width between 91-110 inches Customer Service All our stretchable couch protectors are high quality with exquisite workmanship. We think our premium sofa slipcover will not let you down. If you have any questions, please contact us and we will pleased to help you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816x+-4ZZvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JIVINER","source_asin":"B08HJSHLY4","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-167057","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HJSHLY4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HJSHLY4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":167058,"name":"Waterproof Cover included with 3.3 Cloud9 Queen 2 Inch 100% Visco Elastic Memory Foam Mattress Topper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":362.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715tBmemnqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"3.3 Cloud Visco Elastic Memory Foam out performs and relieves painful pressure points better than the leading competitor with innovative visco elastic memory foam technology and better formulation to help you sleep through the night without tossing and turning, allowing you to awake refreshed and renewed after a good nights sleep.Cloud9 Visco-elastic foam - memory foam - provides an ideal sleeping surface. In normal temperatures it is firm, but when you lay down to sleep it reacts to the temperature of your body and begins to mold itself to your shape. Weight is then distributed evenly along the surface, relieving pressure and helping you to sleep more soundly without tossing and turning. Cloud9 Memory Foam Contours perfectly and molds to your body, superior pressure relief reduces back pain, increased circulation for a deep sleep. They go right on top of your bed - very useful for making a firm, hard or old mattress much more comfortable. The \"Featherlight Sleep System\" will kindle a sincere delight when it's time to retire for the night. Our exclusive, \"Featherlight\" formula makes you feel like you are floating on CLOUD9, sailing forth into a sea of enchanted dreams. We usually recommend that if the person using the visco-elastic memory foam mattress pad weighs under 200lbs and they are just looking for added comfort they should get a 2\" visco-elastic memory foam mattress pad, if they weigh over 200 we definitely recommend a 3\" visco-elastic memory foam mattress pad and for those that weigh over 250lbs the 4\" toppers are the best option for pressure point relief and comfort. The 3.3 Cloud9 visco-elastic memory foam is SUPER SOFT being less dense and having a softer compression or ILD rating. The 4.2 Cloud9 Topper is slightly firmer and provides a little more support while at the same time remaining soft and supple with a slightly more supportive compression or ILD. Our most luxurious 5.3 Cloud9 visco elastic memory foam is firmer than the 3.3 and 4.2 Cloud9.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715tBmemnqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cloud9 Bedding Memory Foam","source_asin":"B07CHMYTFV","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-167058","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CHMYTFV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CHMYTFV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":167059,"name":"Blackout Cordless Valanced Window Shades, Light Grey Fabric Window Blinds, Custom Made Light Filtering Roller Shades for Windows with Valance, 42\" Wid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":103.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81b+e5toxLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MOUNT TYPES: Inside mounted shades will have a deduction taken of approximately 1/4\" to ensure a proper fit inside the window frame.Inside mounted shades require a minimum frame depth of 2inch for secure installation. If your window frame depth is less than 2inch please select outside mount.Outside mounted shades should be ordered with the exact width of the area you wish to cover. Outside mounts are often used when there is not sufficient frame depth for inside mounting.Our shades come with all mounting hardware, and mounting hardware for both inside mount and outside mount. INSIDE MOUNT MEASUREMENT: Step 1. Measure the inside frame width at three locations-the top,middle,and bottom. Record the smallest of the 3 measurements and use that number deduct 1/4inch as your inside width when ordering. Step 2. Measure the height at 3 locations-the left,middle,and right side. Record the smallest of the 3 measurements and use the number as your inside width when ordering. OUTSIDE MOUNT MEASUREMENT: Step 1. Measure the outside frame width adding 6-10inch to be the outside mount width. Step 2. Measure the outside frame length adding 5-10inch to be the outside mount length. The overlap it recommended to allow appropriate coverage and avoid any light gaps. Type: Solid color roller shade. Feature: Thermal Blackout Waterproof Material: Polyester Fabric Installation: All Mounting Hardware Included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81b+e5toxLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PASSENGER PIGEON","source_asin":"B0C2395GWB","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-167059","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2395GWB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2395GWB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
