window.products.push({"id":167087,"name":"Poedist 4 Pcs Bathroom Shower Curtain Set,Peak Blue Honeycomb Marble Bathroom Sets with Rugs(Bath Mat,U Shape and Toilet Lid Cover Mat) and 12 Hooks","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/910FeG6M++L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Great Value 4Pcs Bathroom Decor Set】The beautiful and clear & non-fading bathroom shower curtain sets including waterproof shower curtain and 12 durable hooks, combine with bathroom mat sets- bath mat,U shape and toilet seat cover mat, Creating a atmospheric and elegant and comfortable bathroom environment for you. It is an ideal holiday gift for your friends or loved one.Having a new and comfortable bathroom starts with having a beautiful and functional shower curtain set. 【Perfect Sizes for Your Bathroom】This bathroom combination decoration set suitable for most bathroom(restroom) environments. Perfect sizes as follow: Waterproof shower curtain:72\"L X 72\"W, O shape toilet lid cover mat: 18\"Lx16\"W, Non-slip bath rug: 30\"L X 18\"W, U shape rug size: 20\" L X 20\" W. The plus size and thicker material enhancing the practicality and functionality for this nice set. 【Premium and Reliable Materials】The shower curtain uses a rust-proof metal buckle, high-quality waterproof fabric, light-proof and easy to air dry. A drop line is added at the bottom of the shower curtain to increase the drape of the shower curtain. The thickened mats made from memory foam + short plush gives your feet a softer and more comfortable enjoyment, and the good water absorption function is enough to meet your bathing needs. You will also like the non-slip bottom design of the mats. 【Clear and Fade-Resistant Pattern】Thanks to good quality materials and advanced craftsmanship, this creative atmospheric and elegant pattern will always come out clearly on shower curtains and mats. Even after multiple dippings or prolonged using, it will remains the same and never fades, Always bathe you in a atmospheric and beautiful bathroom atmosphere. 【Tips for You】No.1-The fluorescent effect of the mobile phone or computer may cause a few color difference between the product picture and the actual product, which is a normal phenomenon, please forgive its existence. No.2- Due to the vacuum packaging, the mats has not returned to its original shape when the package is opened, please be patient for a few hours(4-6 hours).If the mats do not lay flat, soak and hang to dry them to solve the problem.Any questions please contact us anytime.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/910FeG6M++L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Poedist","source_asin":"B0BMGKVTCZ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-167087","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMGKVTCZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMGKVTCZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
