window.products.push({"id":167143,"name":"Dadam Silicone Spatula Set of 5 - Silicone Spatulas Heat Resistant with Stainless Steel Core - Non Stick Rubber Spatulas Kitchen Utensils for Cooking,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-3rbIPzwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The highly versatile spatula kitchen utensils can be used as a cake scraper, icing spatula, baking spatula, jar spatula, and even as a mixing spoon. Silicone spatulas set are totally safe and comfortable to use, good-looking, high heat-resistant, durable and flexible. Features : 1. They don’t stick, melt or deform in the heat. 2. They are BPA Free, safe to use on non-stick pans. 3. They don’t stain or retain odors. 4. They won't discolor, warp or chip. 5. They are also dishwasher safe. Flexible but Sturdy : The perfect balance between strength and flexibility, our mini silicone spatula are BPA Free, made from high-quality, flexible, non-sticking and heat-resistant silicone (up to 480°F). The flexible silicone bends with the contours of your bowls, plates and pans to scrape up every last drop. Versatile Set : Whether you’re baking or cooking, flipping or folding, a heatproof silicone spatula is one of the busiest tools in our kitchen. Whether you need an all-purpose tool to turn your fish and flip your pancakes; or you’re looking specifically for something to help with nonstick cookware; scraping bowls, griddles, and grills; or applying frosting to your favorite desserts, our kitchen tools and gadgets will most definitely meet all your kitchen needs. Easy to Hang : If you don’t want to store your small silicone spatula in a drawer, and prefer to have them within arm’s reach, the hanging hole design makes it easy to hang them on the wall. Fast & Easy Clean-Up : 5 Piece silicone spatula are incredibly easy to clean by hand and are dishwasher safe. Save precious time and effort with easy kitchen clean-up. Say No to Bacteria : The innovative seamless design means no seams or cracks to trap food and harmful bacteria. Treat yourself and your family to safe and healthy cooking. Package Include : 5 pcs","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-3rbIPzwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dadam","source_asin":"B07P5FNWR5","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-167143","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07P5FNWR5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07P5FNWR5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
