window.products.push({"id":167223,"name":"CancoFam Round Silicone and Glass Springform Pan - 9-Inch Professional Heavy Duty Heat Resistant Non-Stick Bread Cake Bakery Tin with Quick Release Lo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71frDOY3CuS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CancoFam Round Silicone Springform Pan with Tempered Glass bottom Professional Quality We always put quality first and that is why we rely on top-quality materials and innovative manufacturing techniques to develop premium products used in homes all over the world. The Silicone Cake Pan can safely be used at home or in professional kitchens as it is made from food-safe materials. Time Saving Design Thanks to the 100% food-safe material, our baking pans for cakes can quickly heat up and cool down. This saves you time during baking, and there will be less time waiting for your cake to be ready to frost and decorate. The spring form design allows for quick and smooth release of cakes and cheesecakes with the removable bottom and removable silicone ring. Dependable The cake baking pan is made from Silicone, which is nonreactive. You can easily bake a wide variety of cakes and other goods in our cake pan, even cakes that have citrus ingredients. This pan is very dependable and will last a lifetime when properly cared for. Even Heating When using our round cake pan, you can have peace of mind knowing that your cakes will be thoroughly baked. The material used in the baking mold ensures that the pan heats evenly, so you get the best results every time. This traditional non-stick cake pan can safely withstand high heat ovens up to 450 F and low temperatures up to -40 F. Easy to Clean This lightweight non stick baking mold will be ready to create professional-quality cakes for years to come. We suggest washing these cake pans soon after baking and be sure you dry the cake mold thoroughly to prevent damage by simply rinsing in warm soapy water. If you prefer a deep cleanse, simply place the ring and bottom in the dishwasher and voila! Main Features: - Long Lasting Quality- Quick Release Bottom- Tempered Glass- Lightweight- Dimensions: 6\" x 3\" (23.5 x 23.5 x 9 cm)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71frDOY3CuS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CancoFam","source_asin":"B08R6KTTCV","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-167223","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R6KTTCV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R6KTTCV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
