window.products.push({"id":167234,"name":"OurWarm Wooden Spurtle Set,5 Pcs Natural Teak Wood Kitchen Utensils Set for Nonstick Cookware,Spurtles Kitchen Tools as Seen on TV,Wooden Slotted Spoo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61x-f84nn3L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"◆100% Healthy - The spurtles kitchen tools made of premium natural teak wood with a thick and strong handle, perfectly sanded, smooth, lightweight, strong. Our Spurtle is very smooth and feels good to the touch. The kitchen tools are coated with natural paint(from lacquer tree), no BPA, PVC or phthalates. Harmless to the human body. ◆Heat-Resistant & Scratch-Proof - Wooden utensil set has an excellent heat resistance and will not melt like silicon or rubber while stirring in a hot pot of soup. The kitchen spatulas utensils are firm enough to stir thick, viscous stews or batters. Wood іs the ideal material to make sure not to scratch or damage your expensive cookware! ◆Wide Use - This handmade wood slotted spurtle is very versatile in the kitchen. You'll find these incredible utensils are fantastic for cooking, baking and serving and you'll find yourself reaching for them even more often than your favorite spoons and spatulas. Use it to sift dry ingredients while you mix, separate egg whites, strain cooked pasta or veggies and so much more. ◆Best Spurtle Set - An ideal cooking utensil set that features all the essential kitchen cooking tools. Covers all kitchen needs from mixing to cooking, and has hanging holes for easy wall storage. Help you organize your kitchen better and keep it tidy at all times! And the cooking tools are fantastic gifts for new homeowners or newlyweds. ◆Easy Care - Wash utensils with warm water and a soft sponge. Then hang to dry them. If something sticks to the spoons, just put them in warm water for 5 minutes before washing them. When not in use, please store it in a dry place. When natural teak wood is exposed to oil and heat, its color normally becomes darker, but it can still be used perfectly. Oil them occasionally when feel dry to prevent crack.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61x-f84nn3L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OurWarm","source_asin":"B08TWZZW8S","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-167234","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TWZZW8S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TWZZW8S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
