window.products.push({"id":167316,"name":"IOHOUZE Cotton Red Buffalo Plaid Check Rug Runner 2x6 Red Outdoor Doormat Washable Woven Outdoor Indoor Welcome Mats for Front Door/Farmhouse/Entryway","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91wmkGGa3OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【💖FEATURES & MATERIAL】: Made with hand-woven thick cotton fabric, our buffalo plaid outdoor rug offers great water absorption, good breathability, and impressive durability. Plus, the rug won't fade in the sun, ensuring it looks great for longer. Please note that manual measurement may result in a half-inch deviation. Add this premium outdoor door mat to your space for a touch of functionality and style. 💖【PERFECTLY SIZE】: Perfect size for the front door or in the house. The size of this buffalo plaid outdoor rug is 23.6\" x 70.8\", and checkered mats are more extensive and longer than most floor coverings. Makes an ideal mix with an 18\" x 30\" hello welcome entryway tangle. 【💖PURE WHITE】: The white part of our buffalo plaid rug is a striking pure white, not an off-white or cream color. It's perfect as a outdoor doormat, bathroom rug, front porch rug, apartment rug, area rug, entry door rug, or sofa mat. Don't settle for anything less than pure white – make a statement with our eye-catching front door rug. 【💖EASY TO CLEAN】: This black and white checkered rug is easy to clean with a machine wash, hand wash, or simple vacuum cleaning to quickly blow away dirt. For best results, wash the outdoor mat in cold water with mild detergent on a delicate cycle. It won't shrink and is highly durable. It can also be tumble dried on a low setting without bleach. Keep your door rug looking fresh and clean with minimal effort. 【💖CLASIC PATTERN DESIGN】: Add a touch of classical elegance to your home décor with this black and white buffalo checkered rug. The chic and trendy design is perfect for decorating your front porch, entryway, or living room. It makes for an excellent choice of gift for Christmas, Halloween, and Thanksgiving. You can choose our black and white front door rug that match your room's décor and reflect their personal preferences. 【💖100% SATISFACTORY SERVICE】Our 100% cotton carpets may not lay flat upon arrival due to long-distance transportation. To solve this issue, follow these steps:1.Clean and level the floor surface before laying the carpet to avoid waves.2.Place the carpet on a flat surface like the floor, allowing it to naturally flatten out.3.Use hot water or steam treatment carefully to relax the fibers and restore the shape.Contact us if the problem persists for a refund or replacement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91wmkGGa3OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IOHOUZE","source_asin":"B0BGMT16FY","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-167316","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGMT16FY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGMT16FY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
