window.products.push({"id":167511,"name":"Handstand Kitchen Spring Fling Silicone Butterfly Shaped Silicone Cupcake Mold","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sSsf2az-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You will quickly decide that the best tasting cupcakes are the fanciful ones you've made at home with this whimsical cupcake mold from Handstand Kitchen of course! Food grade silicone cupcake mold makes six butterfly shaped cakes - perfect for your next spring fling party or just because butterflies are awesome! Silicone mold measures approximately 10.2\" x 6.25\" x 1.3\" and is dishwasher safe for easy clean up so you can make your amazing cupcakes again and again. Mold is also excellent for fun soap making projects, too! Handstand Kitchen cookbooks and accessories are the result of the founder's deep desire to introduce children to home-cooked foods in a fun and hands-on way. Handstand Kitchen was launched in 2007 with the goal of getting kids cooking from an early age to empower them with lifelong healthy eating habits. Handstand Kids cookbooks are the perfect recipe for kids to learn about the people, places and language of a new country while also learning to create their own versions of traditional international dishes. Handstand Kitchen accessories include true kitchen quality tools that are sized just right for children as well as aprons for everyone who wants a look that's as beautiful as the dishes they are creating! Join Handstand Kitchen in bringing the pride of accomplishment and traditional comfort of home cooked meals to your children! Handstand Kitchen Real Food Real Fun!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sSsf2az-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Handstand Kitchen","source_asin":"B0B1W63HH8","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-167511","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1W63HH8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1W63HH8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
