window.products.push({"id":167516,"name":"Hand Held Vacuum Cordless: Mini Handheld Vacuum Lightweight Car Vacuum Cleaner Cordless Rechargeable, 9000PA High Power Portable Hand Vacuuming with S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Tjrxgb7gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【POWERFUL MOTOR and SUCTION】Our high power portable mini vacuum has a 9000pa strong suction power and a rated input power of 120W, which can quickly and thoroughly clean up dust, pet hair, and debris. This hand vacuum uses a large suction linear air track: the motor, the dust cup, and the cyclone are located in a straight line, so that the airflow efficiency and suction power are effectively improved, making your cleaning work easier. 【QUICK CHARGE & LONG RUNTIME】The portable hand vacuum cordless rechargeable with no cable and quick charge tech. Its larger power capacity ensures a continuous 18~30 mins working time, and it can be fully charged in 3.5 hours, which is convenient to use, work with independent battery protection. 【MULTI FUNCTIONS MINI VACUUM】Our hand vacuum cordless rechargeable equipped with 3 different shapes of nozzles to meet all usage requirements. The crevice nozzle is designed for cleaning hard-to-reach narrow places, such as under sofas, car seat gaps, and laptops. It is recommended to use the brush nozzle, when cleaning car air outlets and pet hair on carpets. The wide-mouth suction nozzle can be used to large particles, like food crumbs and so on. 【ERGONOMIC DESIGN & LIGHTWEIGHT & LOW NOISE】This handheld vacuum cordless is lightweight and portable, only 1.1pounds, and it will not feel tired even if it is held for a long time. so you can easily pick it up to clean all parts of the room anytime, anywhere, and get rid of the trouble of short or tangled cords.The ergonomic handle design makes cleaning comfortable and effortless.The small vacuum with low noise ≤60dB, and no need to worry about affecting family rest. 【WASHABLE & REMOVABLE HEPA FILTER】This mini handheld vacuum has an advanced design and enhanced stainless steel dual filter. The outer stainless steel filter cover effectively prevents larger particles and gravel from damaging the HEPA filter. The energy efficiency rating of the internal HEPA filter is better than H13, which can capture 99.99% of microparticles. And the HEPA filter can be reusable and washable, Which will help your car vacuum have powerful suction and longer service time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Tjrxgb7gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WANTERONG","source_asin":"B0BJJHYNLN","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-167516","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJJHYNLN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJJHYNLN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
