window.products.push({"id":167557,"name":"Caynel 12.7 Quart Digital Air Fryer with Rotisserie, Dehydrator, Convection Oven, 8 Presets to Air Fry, Roast, Dehydrate, Bake & More, Glass Viewing W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712Rx4nyeEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"VERSATILITY: The Caynel Multi-Functional Air Fryer handles any cooking, baking, rotisserie, dehydrating or air frying task. It is a all-in-one Multi-Cooker that replaces a toaster and convection oven, deep fryer, rotisserie oven, dehydrator oven & microwave. You will get maximum versatility to make many of your favorite recipes— no oil, butter, or lard required. EFFICIENCY: It features high performance Rapid Air Technology that makes food crispy and evenly cooked every time without unwanted fats and oils. 1700 watt stainless steel heating element and 360°air rotation ensures efficient heat up and uniform texture. Express Heat System cooks food up to 30% faster than an oven. FAMILY-SIZED: With a 12.5 Qt total oven and 5 lb. max capacity allows you to make plenty of food so you can make enough food for the whole family, without having to heat up your oven! 3 rack levels allow you to prepare family-sized quantities and you can cook different foods at once like meat and vegetables. CONVENIENT ACCESSORIES: Comes with 6 accessories: 2 removable rack, rotisserie basket, rotisserie spit, skewer rotisserie, drip tray and retrieval tool. Everything will be perfect match to make a homemade meal with ease. Removable drip tray and dishwasher safe parts make cleaning a breeze. Your purchase includes a recipe book specifically made for the Caynel Air Fryer. Oven glove will be given as an extra bonus. EASY-TO-USE: 8 in 1 programmed cooking settings with LED touch screen enables healthier oil-less recipes. Manual time and temperature controls of up to 60 minutes and 400°F. Interior lighting allows you to easily watch your food as it cooks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712Rx4nyeEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CAYNEL","source_asin":"B083R5VRQJ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-167557","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083R5VRQJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083R5VRQJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
