window.products.push({"id":167566,"name":"Mejoroom Full Size Sheet Set,Extra Soft Luxury Brushed Microfiber 1800 Full Sheets with 16 Inch Deep Pocket - Breathable Wrinkle Fade Stain Resistant ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I4skz4GoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"JUST LIKE SLEEPING ON CLOUDS - Mejoroom luxury 4 piece full sheet set are made of 100% Double Brushed Microfiber Polyester.these full size sheets have deep pockets to will fit even the 14-15 inches mattresses, .They are softer,smoother,more resilient and more breathable than even the finest Egyptian cotton to bring you a comfortable and relaxing night's sleep here,make you sleep better and wake up each morning feeling refreshed and full of energy. PERFECT FIT FOR YOUR BED - Includes (flat sheet 81\"x96\"-1PC), (fitted sheet 54\"x75\"-1PC), (pillowcase 20\"x30\"-2PCS). These bed sheets grip and fit better than any other full sheet set! Mejoroom microfiber Bed sheet set is designed to fit nearly all mattresses with a depth that does not exceed 15\". It fits so well that you don't have to worry about how it will loosen up in bed. Also available in Twin, Twin XL, Queen and King sizes. COMFORTABLE ENVIRONMENT - Mejoroom bed sheets are hypoallergenic,those with sensitive skin or conditions like eczema rest in a healing environment instead of being further irritated at night. Our 1800 Series Ultra-Soft Double Brushed microfiber fabric is stain resistant, fade resistant, and wrinkle resistant. . And Mejoroom sheet set is manufactured by factory that is certified OEKO - TEX Standard 100. SELECT PATTARN - Moroccan print design, simple but not monotonous through aqua and white color collocation, visually beautiful and comfortable, give your bedroom a new look. Go into your bedroom, get comfortable in bed, and relax. EASY CARE - They are machine washable in cold water and dry quickly on tumble! Do not bleach. Equivalent to 1800 Thread Count king size Sheets Set. Brand New and Factory Sealed No Ironing Necessary. Say goodbye to wrinkles, and tedious tasks like ironing, and hello to cozy, soft, and comfortable bedding!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I4skz4GoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mejoroom","source_asin":"B0BSVCX9JH","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-167566","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BSVCX9JH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BSVCX9JH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
