window.products.push({"id":167664,"name":"JOSE ARTESANO Woven Pine Needle (Ocoxal) Placemats, Set of 2, 13.8 in X 0.4 in, Star Design w / Metal Rim, Natural Rustic Table Mats, Handcrafted, 100","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810Mvm9VBxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"OUR BRAND JOSE ARTESANO has always been inspired by the organic craftsmanship products creatively made by the artistic hands of Mexico’s artisans. JOSE ARTESANO’s main objective is to portray the richness of the natural resources and the culture hidden behind beautiful Mexico. We produce amazing creations using raw and sustainable materials provided to us by nature. These products are made out of OCOXAL, an ancestral method to create handicrafts that reflect the latent and close contact that Mexican rural communities have with their natural surroundings, the Pine Forest. When the Pine Needles reaches the extraordinary and expert working hands of Mexican artisans, it reveals the unlimited imagination which results in pieces of handicrafts with colorful threads and with a natural aroma of the Pine Forest. Click on our brand name to discover more incredible products from us. Product Description: ✔ Placemat Dimensions: 13.8 IN (Diameter) x .4 IN (Height). ✔ Product Weight: 1.2 Pounds each piece. ✔ Product Materials: Pine Needles, Stainless Steel. ✔ Product Finish: Woven Raw Pine Needle (Ocoxal) and Nickel Plated Stainless Steel. ✔ Brand / Manufacturer: JOSE ARTESANO.✔ Country of Origin: Mexico.✔ Quantity of Items: 2 Pine Needle Placemats with Stainless Steel Rim. ✔ Product Shape: Round, Flat.✔ Product Specifications: Pine Needle products cannot be washed, pressed, and should not be placed in damp places. If it is wet, place it in a well-ventilated area to dry it. The product can give off a pine forest scent. 100% Sustainable and biodegradable.✔ Disclaimers: As these are handcrafted products, each one is unique and they can be slightly different. Products may contain splinters. NON MICROWAVABLE.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810Mvm9VBxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JOSE ARTESANO","source_asin":"B08VD16W6Y","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-167664","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VD16W6Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VD16W6Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
