window.products.push({"id":167685,"name":"Tiger LWU-A172-KM Tiger Thermos Bottle, Insulated Lunch Box, Stainless Steel, Rice Bowl, Approx. 3 Cups, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":46.64,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YguIHB6tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The vacuum insulated bottle construction is the same as a warm lunch box and microwave bottle, keeping your lunch hot for a long time. You can enjoy lunchtime and other lunches. Made of durable, clean stainless steel, the lunch jar has been treated with a smooth, shiny super clean finish. Stain and odor resistant, always clean. The main lid has a sturdy locking mechanism that securely tightens and is removable. A large capacity type that allows you to eat rice well. It can also hold plenty of side dishes. Comes with a special chopstick, approximately 7.9 inches (20 cm) that is easy to use even for large hands. A thick shoulder strap that is easy to carry. Easy to put on and take off with one touch.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YguIHB6tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tiger","source_asin":"B0B782F368","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-167685","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B782F368","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B782F368","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":167686,"name":"Liqueur Malette French Match Striker by Bonnecaze Absinthe & Home","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613g-ilXeCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This unique match strike (or pyrogène in French) is a reproduction of those found throughout late 19th and early 20th century France . At that time, it was common to see a match striker sitting on a bistro table or bar. The strikers served three purposes. First, the hollowed-out top was used to store matches. Secondly, its side or base (with its ribbed surface) was used to strike and ignite the match. And lastly, the piece served as an advertising venue. Many distilleries used these match strikes to promote their liquor, and were usually provided to the bar for free. White-Tip Matches (commonly referred to as \"strike anywhere\" matches) are suggested for use and are available at specialty stores or online. Regular household kitchen matches will not light, as the white-tip match is needed to ignite the match. The strikers can also be used to hold a variety of items such as toothpicks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613g-ilXeCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bonnecaze Absinthe & Home","source_asin":"B08B8YHHMW","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-167686","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08B8YHHMW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08B8YHHMW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
