window.products.push({"id":167759,"name":"WBHome Christmas Glass Ornaments, Hand Crafted Gingerbread Ornaments Set for Christmas Tree, Traditional Xmas Decorations Gifts, 4pcs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81P1x-DL+bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Gingerbread Man Theme] This handcrafted Christmas glass ornament is beautifully designed to incorporate the most traditional baked treats that belong to this holiday into this set. The whole set has a distinct theme, and whether it's hanging on a Christmas tree or as a tabletop decoration, it will bring eye-catching effect and depth to your Christmas decorations this year. [Handcrafted Decor] Our Christmas glass ornaments are handcrafted, a very old and traditional blow moulding process that originated in the 19th century, where artisans heat the glass and place it on a pre-carved mould , it is shaped by blowing air through the mouth. The decorations made by this process are rich in shape and lifelike, and have become the choice of millions of families for Christmas decoration. [Complicated Coloring Process] For each Christmas glass ornament, we insist on manual coloring. Experienced craftsmen restore the most beautiful and true colors to the glass ornaments through several complicated and time-consuming processes. Add the most glamorous glitter powder as an embellishment, and strive to achieve the best display effect. [Packaging and Product List] 1x Gingerbread Boy (3.15\" x 0.75\" x 3.23\"); 1x Christmas Tree (0.75\" x 2.6\" x 4\"); 1x Cookie Cottage (1.81\" x 1.93\" x 3.7\"); 1x Christmas Stocking (2.2\" x 0.55\" x 3.62\"). Since glass ornaments are fragile, we customized the pearl cotton for fixing and put them in the box for protection, and we highly recommend you to use this box to store this glass ornament after the festival, so that your ornament will be protected very safely. [Efficient Customer Service] We are a company dedicated to bringing customers holiday decoration solutions and a variety of holiday decoration products. We focus on the customer's experience. If you have any questions about the product after opening the package, please contact us, we will arrange the customer service team to solve the problem for you as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81P1x-DL+bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WBHome","source_asin":"B0C3LYPDQR","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-167759","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3LYPDQR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3LYPDQR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":167760,"name":"Under Bed Storage Containers, Underbed Storage Bags With Zipper Clear Window Non-Woven Organizer for Clothes Sweater Comforter Blanket Quilts Pillow T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yTxs3fzcL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"HIGH-QUALITY MATERIAL: These under-bed storage bags are made of three layers of 150GSM high-density non-woven fabric, which is breathable, moisture-proof, and odorless. They are an ideal choice for dorms, attics, bedrooms, closets, hatrooms, and utility rooms. LARGE CAPACITY: Each large storage container measures 39.4x19.7x5.9 inches, which is equivalent to a 19.8 GAL (75L) container. It easily accommodates king-size comforters or a large number of clothes. It is a great choice for organizing blankets, pillows, clothes, shoes, and toys. TRANSPARENT COVER: The top of the clothes storage bag is made of transparent PVC, allowing you to easily see the contents inside without having to search through or open it. STURDY HANDLES AND ZIPPERS: The bag has four reinforced handles on the front and sides and is equipped with two #5 stainless steel zippers, greatly increasing its load-bearing capacity and service life. BUY WITH CONFIDENCE: If there are any quality problems with the product after receiving it, please email us before returning it for a faster resolution. We will provide you with a free replacement or refund according to your needs. TIPS: We've taken extra measures to protect your storage bag with an antifreeze material for the transparent window. While there may be some initial wrinkles during the first use, rest assured that they will quickly disappear","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yTxs3fzcL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Coobepono","source_asin":"B0BXP72ML6","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-167760","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXP72ML6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXP72ML6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
