window.products.push({"id":167878,"name":"Turtle Metal Wall Décor or Table Decoration - 3D Design - Hand-Painted - 19” x 19” - Sea Wall Art - Indoor or Outdoor Use – Contemporary Home Decorati","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PGckoe6IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stunning Wall Art for Your Home Amaze your guests with the coastal feel of the Creative Critters Turtle Wall Hanging or Decoration. This beautiful work of art will add immediate color and style to any plain wall or setting either inside or outside. Beautiful and Durable With the hand-painted finish, careful attention to detail has been applied to every aspect of the design. The hand-welded wall hanging is constructed to the highest quality standards. The lacquer finish protects the paint on the front, and a protective coat on the back provides additional protection, making it suitable for covered outdoor areas. Make a Real Impression No matter where you hang or sit it, the Creative Critters Turtle Decor is impossible to miss. It measures 19” x 19” so it fits into most spaces, adding color and style to your home. Easy to Hang The wall hanging has a hook built into the back, making it easy to hang anywhere. All you need to do is drill a single hole and wall plug for a masonry wall, or just use the screw provided and hang up the Turtle. Treat Someone to a Beautiful Gift The Turtle Wall or Table Decor makes the perfect gift for any occasion, for newlyweds, as a housewarming gift, or for any other occasion. Or treat yourself to something special. Dramatically Improve Any Wall or shelf with our Turtle!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PGckoe6IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Creative Critters","source_asin":"B07GSLMC3P","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-167878","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GSLMC3P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GSLMC3P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":167879,"name":"The Source Red Robot Clock RobotTime Moveable Bedside Alarm Analogue Clock Flashing Eyes and Sound","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IW-n5N8xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Clocks and robots have a lot in common, they both have intricate insides full of dials, cogs, gadgets and gizmos - they?re a mechanic's dream! Combine the two together and you?re left with a new and different way to tell the time!These cute Robot Clocks have poseable arms and hands so you can set them up however you like. The analogue clocks inside their abdomens are numbered with some robotic looking digits (if you can describe a font as looking ?roboty?). Each robot has dials, cogs and gauges on their bodies as well as an antenna. The Robot Clock has an alarm too, so you can be woken up every day by your new found robot pal.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IW-n5N8xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Source","source_asin":"B00J8FZNIW","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-167879","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00J8FZNIW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00J8FZNIW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
