window.products.push({"id":167953,"name":"NILUOH Futon Slipcovers Stretch Armless Sofa Slipcover Furniture Protector for Foldable Futon Armless Sofa Cover Folding Couch Shield with Elastic Bot","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jLSjx58yS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Material: This futon slipcover is made of high quality stretchy soft materials: polyester and spandex fabric. Size: This armless sofa cover is suitable for folding sofa beds without armrests with a length of 1.6-1.9 meters. Please measure before purchasing; See measuring guide in photos for a list of all measurements. Elastic Bottom: This futon cover has an elastic bottom design, which is easier to install. Give furniture a whole protection Utility: This armless sofa cover gives the furniture a fresh look and a comfortable feeling while protecting furniture against stains, wear and tear. Care: Machine washable in cold water. Wash separately at gentle cycle. Using mild laundry detergent. Do not bleach.  ●This sofa slipcover without armrests made of durable, 92% polyester fiber and 8% spandex fabric, soft and rich in texture. ●These sofa covers have a high degree of stretchability and exquisite craftsmanship, very suitable for most sizes, practical and beautiful, suitable for your room decoration. ●This folding couch shield is easy to put on and take off, just tuck the extra fabric into the gap between the backrest and the seat area to get a fresh visual effect. ●The armless sofa slipcover not only protect your furniture from dust, but also act as a home painter, turning a dilapidated old sofa into a charming room center. ●This furniture protector without armrest is an indispensable item for shelters with children and pets. It can protect your furniture from stains, abrasion and tearing while providing a refreshing aesthetic. Note: 1.Due to the difference in light and screen, The color of the futon cover may be slightly different from the picture. 2.Please measure your chair before purchase! Please allow 0.5-1 inch differences due to manual measurement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jLSjx58yS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NILUOH","source_asin":"B0C1FTTLBN","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-167953","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1FTTLBN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1FTTLBN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
