window.products.push({"id":167991,"name":"Nestl Extra Twin Deep Pocket Sheets Set - 4 PC Soft Microfiber Twin Sheets Deep Pocket - Fade Resistant Bedding Sheets & Pillowcases - Twin, Hunter Gr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YBGkbglFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Microfiber EXTRA DEEP POCKET SHEETS: Deep pocket sheets fit deep pocket 18, 20, 21, 22, and 24-inch mattresses. These are great for extra deep matresses/large matresses/very tall matresses and fits well matresses with 3 inch or 4 inch memory foam mattress toppers, double pillow top, memory foam toppers, or big mattress pads! TWIN SIZED: includes one extra deep pocket fitted sheet, 1 flat sheet, and two pillowcases. Extra deep pocket fitted sheet measures 75 inches x 39 inches with 21-inch pockets. Flat Sheets measure 96 inches x 66 inches. Pillowcases measure 20 x 30 inches. Also available in Twin, Twin XL, Full, Full XL, Queen, and King sizes. SUPER SOFT PREMIUM MICROFIBER: Hotel-quality bedding is woven from the highest quality microfiber material, double brushed on both sides for ultimate softness and comfort. ELEGANT AND VIBRANT: our bedding is pet-friendly and made to last. Our fabulous selection of vibrant colors won’t fade after washing and the classic stripe detail is a beautiful, elegant way to update your bedroom. 100% SATISFACTION: Welcome to the Nestl Bedding family! Our #1 goal is to provide you with unparalleled customer service and we’re only happy if our customers are happy! Shop with confidence because no matter what, we’ve got you covered!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YBGkbglFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"nestl","source_asin":"B0BS3SXB93","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-167991","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BS3SXB93","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BS3SXB93","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":167992,"name":"Cosy House Collection Elegant Pattern Sheets - Twin Size Sheet Set - Silky Soft - Deep Pocket Fitted, Breathable, Easy Care- 3 Piece Bedset (Twin, Bro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":47.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VZNlB9UCS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BUTTERY SMOOTH & SOFT - Ready for ultimate comfort? With our Elegant Pattern sheets, you'll be reveling in soothing softness. The secret is in our high quality, tightly knit, microfiber fabric. Our linens are double-brushed for creamy smoothness, and are softer than silk. Already beautifully packaged, with a tassel-trim zipper for easy access & storage, this comfy bedset is the perfect wedding or housewarming gift for cozy sleepers! BUTTERY SMOOTH & SOFT - Ready for ultimate comfort? With our Elegant Pattern sheets, you'll be reveling in soothing softness. The secret is in our high quality, tightly knit, microfiber fabric. Our linens are double-brushed for creamy smoothness, and are softer than silk. Already beautifully packaged, with a tassel-trim zipper for easy access & storage, this comfy bedset is the perfect wedding or housewarming gift for cozy sleepers! DURABLE & BREATHABLE - Why are our Cosy House sheets a great choice? Stronger than even the highest thread count Egyptian cotton, these luxury hotel style sheets resist fading, last longer compared to other brands, and are incredibly durable. You'll be able to rest easy in summer or winter - all year round - because of our elegant, breathable, plush bed sheets. DEEP POCKETED  FITTED SHEETS - Our signature cooling sheets and bedding are stretchy and can fit up to 16 inch mattresses. Plus, it has elastic all around (not just at corners), so it stays snug and secure all night long. To top it off, each Twin sized bedset includes 1 Fitted Sheet, 1 Flat Sheet, and 1 Pillowcase. Pick your favorite color or a patterned set, and you'll be ready for a luxe, comfortable, slumber. EASY CARE - These sheets are machine washable and dryer friendly! Our bed sheets like ours ward off common non-living allergens and are odor, stain, and wrinkle resistant. No need for ironing. You won't even break a sweat! Say goodbye to stinky sheets, because ours stay fresher for longer. Wash in cold water and tumble dry on low heat to avoid pilling. PEACE OF MIND - Boasting a gorgeous matte-&-shine pattern for wallet friendly prices, our 1800 sheets are guaranteed high quality for less. They come in a variety of colors and styles, and are carefully crafted and made from mindful materials. We care about our Cosy community and are here for you every step of the way.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VZNlB9UCS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cosy House Collection","source_asin":"B088LJ24YJ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-167992","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088LJ24YJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088LJ24YJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
